OL,5,G2200 Sarah Millican: Late Bloomer
OL,6,     FWhen Sarah Millican was a bairn,
OL,7,     Fshe wouldn't say boo to a goose.
OL,8,     FBut now? She's goose-booing all
OL,9,     Fover the shop! Sarah's seventh
OL,10,     Fstand-up special explores how one
OL,11,     FSarah became the other.
OL,12,G2305 Scream
OL,13,     F(2022) Meta-comedy horror
OL,14,     F're-quel' with Courteney Cox.
OL,15,     FKiller Ghostface returns to shock
OL,16,     Fthe younger generation out of
OL,17,     Ftheir love of 'elevated horror'
OL,18,     Fwith a bit of old-fashioned
OL,19,     Fslashing.
